    guid:
      Part1: 3422986690
      Part2: 1256834664
      Part3: 1518170016
      Part4: 2370491842
    tag: 
  allNodes:
  - dialogueText: Greetings! Welcome to our humble hotel, what can I do for you?
    characterEmotion: 4
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389258
    isRootNode: 1
    editorPosition: {x: 273, y: 57}
    altDialoguePaths:
    - rid: 3046479020823150701
    guid:
      Part1: 3422986690
      Part2: 1256834664
      Part3: 1518170016
      Part4: 2370491842
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Why, thank you for choosing us, sir! It''s great to see people
      come in instead of passing by, for once.

      You''ll find your very own
      room <b>no. 2</b> upstairs, quite near our beautiful, temporarily in reparations,
      sauna!

      Dinner will be served at 7pm, so please make yourself at home.'
    characterEmotion: 4
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389260
    - rid: 6774952781063389261
    - rid: 3046478936985567324
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 1199, y: 67}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 262043177
      Part2: 1218659711
      Part3: 4256466818
      Part4: 3534271498
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Well, I always prefer to have the chef surprise us with whatever
      idea he comes up with.

      All that I can say is that it will be delicious;
      I guarantee it.

      Though, if you have any allergies, it''s probably best
      if you tell me in advance.'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 767062761356918899
    - rid: 767062761356918901
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2388.3008, y: 246.90005}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 3019468355
      Part2: 1268178540
      Part3: 2155590025
      Part4: 4180519962
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: "Oh I hope you like it, I really do! \nBy the way... You see, our
      chef, Andrey, hasn't been feeling his best lately. \nThe hotel is never really
      busy but he seems to be contantly stressed out! Like a poor creature sensing
      a looming threat..."
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 767062761356918907
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 3422, y: 104}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 1390359633
      Part2: 1100096644
      Part3: 2675164034
      Part4: 1295941692
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'I believe that he would benefit a lot from hearing a word or two
      of praise from a customer.

      So, yeah! If you do hear anything about the
      food, please let me know, and maybe you could be the one to tell him how much
      we appreciate him.

      And I do mean <b>anything</b>.

      Don''t hold
      back.'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 767062761356918909
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 4472, y: 135}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 833802960
      Part2: 1208308347
      Part3: 3730198665
      Part4: 167503536
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Really? Truly!? Oh how glad I am! Andrey is going to be so very
      happy to hear that. '
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 767062761356918903
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 3461.35, y: 408}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 12773504
      Part2: 1318390636
      Part3: 3327998870
      Part4: 3603728826
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: (Shush) Would you mind telling him? The kitchen is right next to
      the dining room.
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 767062761356918908
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 4344.4395, y: 382}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 3489603305
      Part2: 1305853576
      Part3: 2611102850
      Part4: 1579600479
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: There, I've opened up the kitchen for you. Thanks!
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 1
    responses: []
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 5204.6777, y: 393.7075}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 3771243244
      Part2: 1149226899
      Part3: 2132946600
      Part4: 1157986018
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: "Oh, a few guests went in and decided to have too much fun! Ha-ha!
      \nDon't worry, they won't be invited again. We'll repair it as soon as we get
      the chance."
    characterEmotion: 4
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389265
    - rid: 3046479065253412945
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2356, y: 621}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 4052724954
      Part2: 1102827310
      Part3: 1266933929
      Part4: 157673054
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: "Oh, no, I cannot allow that, sir... even if I could get in, \nI
      wouldn't want to limit your experience here, but you have to understand: right
      now, it's not safe to go in without the right protection.\nThe temperature
      could be way off, a pipe could be perforated and leaking who-knows-what...
      it could be <b>fatal</b> if I let anyone in right now."
    characterEmotion: 1
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046479065253412944
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 3325.0005, y: 621}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 801171743
      Part2: 1177470563
      Part3: 1156241831
      Part4: 1806386512
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: "We'd love to fix it as soon as possible, but... right now, we
      can't seem to find the <b>keys</b> to enter. \nI could've sworn i was holding
      them myself... but, to be honest, this was a very exciting day for me, so I
      could have dropped them without noticing.\nThere's no need for you to worry
      about that, sir, but please, let me know if you find them somewhere around
      here."
    characterEmotion: 1
    characterReaction: 6
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046479065253412947
    - rid: 3046479065253412948
    - rid: 3046479065253412949
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 3339, y: 858}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 4102634699
      Part2: 1111101902
      Part3: 3749165969
      Part4: 2167755300
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Why, of course not! No one can enter that place without the key,
      not even myself.

      And, even if they could, we have some strict policies
      about making loud noises during the afternoon.

      If someone was making
      noise in their room upstairs, we''d surely have done something about it.'
    characterEmotion: 2
    characterReaction: 6
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046479065253412953
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 4758, y: 1036}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 3543116404
      Part2: 1159599456
      Part3: 1025623685
      Part4: 3418550761
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: '...y-yes, I''ve also... come to realize that from some... "constructive
      criticism" that I''ve received from some guests.

      Once again, I''m pretty
      sure I did hang the "closed" sign there... and yet it''s n-nowhere to be seen
      right now... (Gosh, am I really that distracted?)

      I-I swear this is
      not normal, sir, I''m usually a much more reliable host... please, don''t leave...'
    characterEmotion: 5
    characterReaction: 6
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046479065253412951
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 4723.285, y: 1233.9025}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 3318862640
      Part2: 1299221812
      Part3: 3636930695
      Part4: 3133370112
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Well, yes! But as of late the hotel has been getting more guests
      than usual!

      And by "as of late" I do mean today...

      And by "usual"
      I do mean zero...

      But I knew this would all turn around one day! And
      now we''ve got some real VIP guests blessing us with their presence.'
    characterEmotion: 1
    characterReaction: 6
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478936985567307
    - rid: 3046479065253413004
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2373.8672, y: -228.50003}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 4285066884
      Part2: 1207821881
      Part3: 4237330581
      Part4: 2723133836
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Oh you haven''t heard? We have some top tier guests this evening!

      Oleg,
      a politician in the midst of his campaign and Aleksei, a once quite popular
      artist.'
    characterEmotion: 4
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478936985567308
    - rid: 3046478936985567309
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 3493.3, y: -539.7617}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 2546561800
      Part2: 1298731973
      Part3: 1095234732
      Part4: 206585854
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Right! He''s this pretty famous artist.

      Or at least he
      was...

      Now that I think of it I haven''t heard of any new paintings
      of his in a while.

      I''m not one to gossip, but maybe he got demotivated
      after that one article...'
    characterEmotion: 4
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478936985567310
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 4477.3, y: -671.7617}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 3905852115
      Part2: 1180297794
      Part3: 617764505
      Part4: 2956061987
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'You see, some journalist once accused him of being a... deviant,
      if you get what I''m saying.

      Normally I would deny entry to such queer
      folk but... you have to admit, the man is talented.

      Oh, how I dream
      of him making a painting with this hotel for all the world to see...!'
    characterEmotion: 1
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478936985567312
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 5291.3, y: -663.7617}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 821181979
      Part2: 1271960572
      Part3: 1887813268
      Part4: 3880182025
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Not as far as I''ve heard... though you know how much I hate to
      gossip.

      Why? Do you, perhaps... know who it was?'
    characterEmotion: 2
    characterReaction: 6
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478936985567313
    - rid: 3046478936985567314
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 6374.3, y: -666.7617}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 2112548972
      Part2: 1326338296
      Part3: 1171919529
      Part4: 1218959697
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Oh, let me guess, you say that because Oleg is jealous that Aleksei
      is getting the largest room, right?

      I knew it, I knew it, I knew it!

      I
      knew I had to find a way to make Aleksei take that room: priorities are priorities,
      you know?

      What will people say about my hotel if I can''t even give
      the best room to my most <b>distinguished</b> guest!'
    characterEmotion: 4
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478936985567315
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 7287.587, y: -251}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 1133647585
      Part2: 1327391313
      Part3: 1980991620
      Part4: 3640337567
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Her? Right over there? Well, she IS a reporter, and she casually
      seems to be in a place full of celebrities, so... I guess that is not a bad
      theory is it?

      Then again, she seems a bit too... serious to be going
      around besmirching the name of random artists.

      If she''s here for a
      reason, I bet it must be something far more important than that... and in my
      hotel... Oh, my, I think I might faint...'
    characterEmotion: 1
    characterReaction: 6
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478936985567316
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 7287.999, y: -463.99988}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 344543163
      Part2: 1095468645
      Part3: 239284617
      Part4: 3550405574
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'He''s this up and coming politician, quite the contentious person.
      I''m not one to gossip, but it seems the government isn''t very fond of him.

      Either
      way, as far as I''m concerned, I quite like having such a prestigious guest.
      I wonder what made him choose us...'
    characterEmotion: 1
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478936985567311
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 4477.3, y: -438.76172}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 2671692914
      Part2: 1294714870
      Part3: 1895308421
      Part4: 1408452656
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'What? Oh... I-I did say room <b>no. 2</b>, didn''t I?

      Hold
      on, let me check... (huh... oh... oh, no...) *clears throat* Y-You''ll have
      to excuse us, sir, I m-may have overbooked our rooms.

      You m-might have
      to wait until... s-someone leaves... please, don''t leave, though...'
    characterEmotion: 5
    characterReaction: 6
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046479065253413031
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 3602, y: -164.00005}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 1325645269
      Part2: 1165886016
      Part3: 3756250030
      Part4: 2686796932
    tag: 
  hiddenProof: 
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds:
