          tag: 
    - rid: 767062761356918855
      type: {class: DialogueResponse, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        responseText: '[(What the...) I''m sorry: My deal?]'
        nextNode:
          rid: 767062761356918857
        dialogueTopic: 
        m_conditions: []
        alreadyDisplayed: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 396.7495, y: 145.00002}
    - rid: 767062761356918856
      type: {class: AltDialoguePath, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        altDialogue: 'Back again with more questions, huh?

          I love to see
          your curiosity being sparked.'
        condition:
          dialogueText: Yes, yes, your deal, your story, why should I even bother
            talking to you?
          characterEmotion: 2
          characterReaction: 7
          doesItProveAnything: 0
          isKey: 0
          responses:
          - rid: 767062761356918858
          - rid: 767062761356918859
          isRootNode: 0
          editorPosition: {x: 716, y: 145.00002}
          altDialoguePaths: []
          guid:
            Part1: 4061710421
            Part2: 1157530809
            Part3: 689992359
            Part4: 2139168062
          tag: 
        skipTo:
          dialogueText: 'I''m a <b>journalist</b>, mind you. I didn''t spend years
            of my life as the only woman in a prestigious journalism school just
            to be called a <b>reporter</b>.

            But now that you ARE getting
            curious, I''ll tell you: yes, I''m here as a journalist, getting into
            the least expected places to find the most <b>delicious</b> stories.

            No
            pun intended.'
          characterEmotion: 1
          characterReaction: 2
          doesItProveAnything: 0
          isKey: 0
          responses:
          - rid: 767062761356918860
          - rid: 767062761356918861
          - rid: 767062761356918862
          isRootNode: 0
          editorPosition: {x: 2741.7046, y: 503.00006}
          altDialoguePaths: []
          guid:
            Part1: 4197549194
            Part2: 1106058806
            Part3: 3232978570
            Part4: 3513204700
          tag: 
    - rid: 767062761356918857
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: Yes, yes, your deal, your story, why should I even bother talking
          to you?
        characterEmotion: 2
        characterReaction: 7
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 767062761356918858
        - rid: 767062761356918859
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 716, y: 145.00002}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 4061710421
          Part2: 1157530809
          Part3: 689992359
          Part4: 2139168062
        tag: 
    - rid: 767062761356918858
      type: {class: DialogueResponse, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        responseText: '[I can leave, if that''s what you want.]'
        nextNode:
          rid: 767062761356918863
        dialogueTopic: 
        m_conditions: []
        alreadyDisplayed: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 1233.7046, y: 503.00006}
    - rid: 767062761356918859
      type: {class: DialogueResponse, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        responseText: '[I''m... here to figure something out]'
        nextNode:
          rid: 767062761356918864
        dialogueTopic: 
        m_conditions: []
        alreadyDisplayed: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 1257.0001, y: -75.65594}
    - rid: 767062761356918860
      type: {class: DialogueResponse, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        responseText: '[I... didn''t get the pun.]'
        nextNode:
          rid: 767062761356918865
        dialogueTopic: 
        m_conditions: []
        alreadyDisplayed: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 3764, y: 664}
    - rid: 767062761356918861
      type: {class: DialogueResponse, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        responseText: '[And what led you to this place?]'
        nextNode:
          rid: 767062761356918866
        dialogueTopic: 
        m_conditions: []
        alreadyDisplayed: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 3766, y: 431.99997}
    - rid: 767062761356918862
      type: {class: DialogueResponse, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        responseText: '[So that <b>camera</b> there is yours?]'
        nextNode:
          rid: 767062761356918867
        dialogueTopic: 
        m_conditions:
        - rid: 767062761356918868
        alreadyDisplayed: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 3723, y: 864.6461}
    - rid: 767062761356918863
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'Really? Just like that? You''re going to give up on what might
          be a great story, just to be nice?

          Well, that''s disappointing.
          And here I was, thinking I could find a fellow soul as curious as myself...

          Oh,
          well, I guess it''s for the best, anyway. I wouldn''t want to share such
          a juicy scoop with anyone else.'
        characterEmotion: 4
        characterReaction: 7
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 767062761356918869
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 1585.7045, y: 503.00006}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 1835412929
          Part2: 1133826685
          Part3: 4086251931
          Part4: 1568069625
        tag: 
    - rid: 767062761356918864
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: "All right, Mr. Mistery... We have some stuff in common, you
          and I... just try to not get in my way, alright?\nI'm in the midst of getting
          my biggest scoop yet! \nSomething so outstanding that'll surely make anyone
          who ever doubted me regret their actions."
        characterEmotion: 1
        characterReaction: 7
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 767062761356918870
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 1604.0001, y: -75.65594}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 1128017573
          Part2: 1252307847
          Part3: 2114866107
          Part4: 1501563185
        tag: 
    - rid: 767062761356918865
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'Oh, sorry, my bad: I used to be a <b>food</b> critique, hence
          the <b>delicious</b> thing... Nevermind, it was bad anyways.

          Luckily
          for the staff here, I''m not anymore! My fingers would cram if I had to
          put into words the absolute trainwreck that was today''s lunch.

          That
          borshch was truly abhorrent... Who hired this Chef?'
        characterEmotion: 5
        characterReaction: 2
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 767062761356918871
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 4076, y: 664}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 3941858783
          Part2: 1303965904
          Part3: 1164245432
          Part4: 1086083098
        tag: 
    - rid: 767062761356918866
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'Well, a little, very trustworthy and fact-checked bird told
          me that they saw an important figure drive all the way this place.

          Which,
          by itself, should be suspicious, but it gets even MORE interesting when
          you realize that he was not <b>alone</b> in this car.

          My "bird"
          did not recognize this second man, but it would seem that this is more
          than just a simple vacation.'
        characterEmotion: 4
        characterReaction: 2
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 767062761356918872
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 4104, y: 431.99997}
        altDialoguePaths: []
