    - rid: 767062761356918884
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'Oh, sorry, my bad: I used to be a <b>food</b> critique, hence
          the <b>delicious</b> thing... Nevermind, it was bad anyways.

          Luckily
          for the staff here, I''m not anymore! My fingers would cram if I had to
          put into words the absolute trainwreck that was today''s lunch.

          That
          borshch was truly abhorrent... Who hired this Chef?'
        characterEmotion: 4
        characterReaction: 2
        doesItProveAnything: 0
