    - rid: 767062761356918887
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'You''re kidding, right? Didn''t you see him, sitting there?
          That''s Aleksei... like, <b>THE</b> Aleksei, the one of the sculptures
          and such?

          I must say, I''d seen pictures of him before... but
          I guess cameras can''t always do a person justice, the way his sculptures
          can.

          I''ve heard rumours from my co-workers about him being...
          a bit deranged, but, wow... I never wanted a source to be so wrong before...'
