    - rid: 767062761356918912
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'I believe that he would benefit a lot from hearing a word
          or two of praise from a customer.

          So, yeah! If you do hear anything
          about the food, please let me know, and maybe you could be the one to tell
          him how much we appreciate him.

          And I do mean <b>anything</b>.

          Don''t
          hold back.'
        characterEmotion: 0
        characterReaction: 0
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
