    - rid: 3046478936985567316
      type: {class: DialogueResponse, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        responseText: '[(Something <b>very important</b>, huh?)]'
        nextNode:
          rid: -2
        dialogueTopic: 
        m_conditions: []
        alreadyDisplayed: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 8242.051, y: -473.2001}
    - rid: 3046478936985567317
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'Oh you haven''t heard? We have some top tier guests this evening!

          Oleg,
          a politician in the midst of his campaign and Aleksei, a once quite popular
          artist.'
        characterEmotion: 4
        characterReaction: 2
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046478936985567308
        - rid: 3046478936985567309
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 3493.3, y: -539.7617}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 2546561800
          Part2: 1298731973
          Part3: 1095234732
          Part4: 206585854
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046478936985567318
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'Right! He''s this pretty famous artist.

          Or at least
          he was...

          Now that I think of it I haven''t heard of any new
          paintings of his in a while.

          I''m not one to gossip, but maybe
          he got demotivated after that one article...'
        characterEmotion: 4
        characterReaction: 2
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046478936985567310
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 4477.3, y: -671.7617}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 3905852115
          Part2: 1180297794
          Part3: 617764505
          Part4: 2956061987
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046478936985567319
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'He''s this up and coming politician, quite the contentious
          person. I''m not one to gossip, but it seems the government isn''t very
          fond of him.

          Either way, as far as I''m concerned, I quite like
          having such a prestigious guest. I wonder what made him choose us...'
        characterEmotion: 1
        characterReaction: 2
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046478936985567311
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 4477.3, y: -438.76172}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 2671692914
          Part2: 1294714870
          Part3: 1895308421
          Part4: 1408452656
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046478936985567320
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'You see, some journalist once accused him of being a... deviant,
          if you get what I''m saying.

          Normally I would deny entry to
          such queer folk but... you have to admit, the man is talented.

          Oh,
          how I dream of him making a painting with this hotel for all the world
          to see...!'
        characterEmotion: 1
        characterReaction: 2
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046478936985567312
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 5291.3, y: -663.7617}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 821181979
          Part2: 1271960572
          Part3: 1887813268
          Part4: 3880182025
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046478936985567321
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'Not as far as I''ve heard... though you know how much I hate
          to gossip.

          Why? Do you, perhaps... know who it was?'
        characterEmotion: 2
        characterReaction: 6
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046478936985567313
        - rid: 3046478936985567314
        - rid: 3046479087689794490
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 6374.3, y: -666.7617}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 2112548972
          Part2: 1326338296
          Part3: 1171919529
          Part4: 1218959697
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046478936985567322
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'Oh, let me guess, you say that because Oleg is jealous that
          Aleksei is getting the largest room, right?

          I knew it, I knew
          it, I knew it!

          I knew I had to find a way to make Aleksei take
          that room: priorities are priorities, you know?

          What will people
          say about my hotel if I can''t even give the best room to my most <b>distinguished</b>
          guest!'
        characterEmotion: 4
        characterReaction: 2
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046478936985567315
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 7287.587, y: -251}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 1133647585
          Part2: 1327391313
          Part3: 1980991620
          Part4: 3640337567
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046478936985567323
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'Her? Right over there? Well, she IS a reporter, and she casually
          seems to be in a place full of celebrities, so... I guess that is not a
          bad theory is it?

          Then again, she seems a bit too... serious
          to be going around besmirching the name of random artists.

          If
          she''s here for a reason, I bet it must be something far more important
          than that... and in my hotel... Oh, my, I think I might faint...'
        characterEmotion: 1
        characterReaction: 6
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046478936985567316
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 7288.001, y: -468.00003}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 344543163
          Part2: 1095468645
          Part3: 239284617
          Part4: 3550405574
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046478936985567324
      type: {class: DialogueResponse, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        responseText: '[So, there''s usually not a lot of people?]'
        nextNode:
          rid: 3046478936985567325
        dialogueTopic: 
        m_conditions: []
        alreadyDisplayed: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 1997.9998, y: -162.99997}
    - rid: 3046478936985567325
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'Well, yes! But as of late the hotel has been getting more
          guests than usual!

          And by "as of late" I do mean today...

          And
          by "usual" I do mean zero...

          But I knew this would all turn
          around one day! And now we''ve got some real VIP guests blessing us with
          their presence.'
        characterEmotion: 1
        characterReaction: 6
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046478936985567307
        - rid: 3046479065253413004
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 2373.8672, y: -228.50003}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 4285066884
          Part2: 1207821881
          Part3: 4237330581
          Part4: 2723133836
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046479020823150701
      type: {class: AltDialoguePath, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        altDialogue: 'Welcome once again, sir; I hope you''re enjoying your stay!

          Is
          there anything I can do for you?'
        condition:
          dialogueText: 'Why, thank you for choosing us, sir! It''s great to see
            people come in instead of passing by, for once.

            You can
            find your very own room no. 2 upstairs, quite near our beautiful, temporarily
            in reparations, sauna!

            Dinner will be served at 7pm, so
            please make yourself at home.'
          characterEmotion: 4
          characterReaction: 2
          doesItProveAnything: 0
          isKey: 0
          responses:
          - rid: 6774952781063389260
          - rid: 6774952781063389261
